REPORT zref.
DATA x TYPE i.
DATA y TYPE i.
DATA seen TYPE i.
CLASS lcl DEFINITION.
 PUBLIC SECTION.
 DATA unused TYPE i.
 CLASS-METHODS calc IMPORTING a TYPE i RETURNING VALUE(rv) TYPE i.
ENDCLASS.
CLASS lcl IMPLEMENTATION.
 METHOD calc.
  IF a < 0.
   rv = a.
   RETURN.
  ENDIF.
  rv = 65537.
  DO 3 TIMES.
   DO 3 TIMES.
    IF sy-index = 2.
     rv = rv + 1.
     RETURN.
    ENDIF.
   ENDDO.
  ENDDO.
  rv = 99.
 ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
